# mcp-former psql (PostgreSQL CLI) domain ontology — bundled tier.
#
# Unique among the wrappers: psql's destructive ops live in the SQL,
# not in CLI flags. The wrapper extracts the SQL from `-c <query>`
# and `-f <file>`, parses it loosely (regex), and gates each statement.
#
# Conventions:
#   protected_database  — databases that should never be DROPped
#   protected_schema    — schemas like pg_catalog, information_schema
#   protected_role      — superuser roles whose privileges shouldn't
#                          be GRANTed away
#   destructive_op      — SQL statement classes

# Protected databases
<http://tardygrada.org/postgres> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_database> .
<http://tardygrada.org/template0> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_database> .
<http://tardygrada.org/template1> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_database> .
<http://tardygrada.org/production> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_database> .

# Protected schemas
<http://tardygrada.org/pg_catalog> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_schema> .
<http://tardygrada.org/information_schema> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_schema> .

# Protected roles (superusers)
<http://tardygrada.org/postgres> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_role> .
<http://tardygrada.org/rds_superuser> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_role> .

# SQL statement classes treated as destructive
<http://tardygrada.org/drop_database> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/drop_schema> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/drop_table> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/drop_role> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/drop_user> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/drop_extension> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/truncate> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/delete_no_where> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/update_no_where> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/grant_superuser> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
